RULE_VERSION: 1.0
RULE_NAME: AI_MEETING_ASSISTANT
APP_TYPE: AI / PRODUCTIVITY
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: Make https://github.com/cannoi/ai-meeting-assistant a usable meeting assistant, not a demo shell.

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Create meeting
- Meeting notes
- AI summarization
- Action items
- Meeting history
- Persistent storage
- Root UI on /
- Health route
- SoloHost runtime compatibility

FUNCTIONAL ACCEPTANCE:
- Opening / shows the meeting UI, not Cannot GET /
- Notes can be saved
- Summary is generated when a provider key exists
- Data survives restart
- Container stays up on 0.0.0.0

STOP CONDITIONS:
- Required AI key missing
- High-risk architecture change
